{"words": [{"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تَقُولُوا۟", "translation": "say"}, {"text": "لِمَن", "translation": "for (the ones) who"}, {"text": "يُقْتَلُ", "translation": "are slain"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "أَمْوَٰتٌۢ ۚ", "translation": "(They are) dead"}, {"text": "بَلْ", "translation": "Nay"}, {"text": "أَحْيَآءٌۭ", "translation": "(they are) alive"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِن", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "you (do) not"}, {"text": "تَشْعُرُونَ", "translation": "perceive"}], "sahih": "And do not say about those who are killed in the way of Allāh, \"They are dead.\" Rather, they are alive, but you perceive [it] not."}